<lb/>entreaties, the militia having mutinied, <lb/>and the greater part of them
ready to <lb/>join the mob; the brethren came to the <lb/>conclusion to leave
that place, and <lb/>seek a shelter elsewhere; they conse<lb/>quently took
their departure, with a<lb/>bout seventy waggons, with the rem<lb/>nant of the
